OL,3,GNEWSABattery fire warning after 'sharp
OL,4,Arise' in incidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Reform UK-controlled council said
OL,7,Fthe fires correlated with a "huge
OL,8,Fincrease" in vapes, many of which
OL,9,Fcontain lithium-ion batteries, being
OL,10,Fplaced into household waste.
